  "dataset_summary": {
    "plain_description": "Football match results for a 20-team season, including per-match scores plus goal-time and scorer lists, together with reference sheets for the canonical team list, team prime tokens used in checksum calculations, team-specific stop-time parameters, and a derived pairwise series table from the Bonus matrix for two-leg winners under the away-goals rule.",
    "n_tables": 4,
    "notes": "Data contains one row per match. Check_Sum yields the canonical team dimension by combining the team list block with the Primes column. Q16 contains one stop-time value per team. Bonus is represented as a derived long fact table with one row per unordered team pair (190 rows) extracted from the upper-triangle editable cells of the matrix; instruction rows below the matrix are excluded."
  }
